Replace this file with your real google-services.json.

Get it from: Firebase Console → Project settings → Your apps → Android app
(package name: com.affilio.app) → "google-services.json" download button.

Rename it to exactly: google-services.json
and place it at: android/app/google-services.json

Do NOT commit your real google-services.json to a public repository if the
project contains sensitive API restrictions — for most consumer apps it's
safe to ship (it does not contain secrets), but confirm your own API key
restrictions in Google Cloud Console regardless.
